    "long_instructions": "##Exploring Sensors\r\n1. Click **one sensor** from the sensor bar.\r\n2. **Hover over** or **click** something in the park to preview the sensor's reading.\r\n3. Read the description of the sensor's data and add it to your activity guide.\r\n4. Try the same sensor on several objects, then switch sensors and do it again.",
